  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "We apply the options on the given equation & solve it using BODMAS rule:\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \nOption 1) ×, +, -, =\n\n__**30 × 4**__ + 2 - 1 = 121\n\n__**120 +**____** 2**__ - 1 = 121\n\n__**122 -**____** 1**__ = 121\n\n121 = 121\n\nOption 2) ×, -, ÷, =\n30 × 4 - __**2 ÷ 1**__ = 121\n\n__**30 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 2 = 121\n\n__**120 - 2**__ = 121\n\n118 ≠ 121\n\nOption 3) ×, -, +, =\n__**30 × 4**__ - 2 + 1 = 121\n\n__**120**__ - 2 __**+**____** 1**__ = 121\n\n__**121 - 2**__ = 121 \n\n119 ≠ 121\n\nOption 4) ÷, +, -, =\n__**30 ÷ 4**__ + 2 - 1 = 121\n\n__**7.5 +**____** 2**__ - 1 = 121\n\n__**9.5 -**____** 1**__ = 121\n\n8.5 ≠ 121\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 1)**",
